                    "content": "    def postprocess(self, occurrences):         retained = tuple(occurrences)         if any(not isinstance(item, WebsiteTextOccurrence) for item in retained):             raise TypeError(                 \"WebsiteToText.postprocess requires occurrence envelopes from scan().\"             )         self._postprocess_occurrences(retained)         return self._legacy_outputs(retained)"
